WEBVTT

00:00:00.149 --> 00:00:01.510
For nine months, I worked at

00:00:01.510 --> 00:00:03.190
Management Solutions in the

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.229
Advanced Analytics team of a major

00:00:05.229 --> 00:00:07.470
Spanish bank. I measured the

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.110
impact of a predictive credit

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:10.830
model through an A/B test on

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.270
millions of records using SQL and

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:15.589
PySpark on AWS.

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:17.309
When my project partner moved to

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.870
another workstream, I took full

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.670
responsibility for a complex

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.630
analysis and worked directly with

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:24.870
the client to deliver it. I left

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.430
with a full-time offer and my

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.302
supervisor's letter is just below.
